            "heading": "1. Best-Selling Flavors & Travel Friendly",
            "subheadline_1": "Fresh On-the-Go",
            "subheadline_2": "Flavor Match",
            "body": "<p>Invigorating or soothing, our flavors do it all. Powered by n-Ha for gentle enamel care without fluoride, plus travel-friendly freshness wherever you go.</p>",
