            "review_1_author": "Anne L.",
            "review_2_highlight": "The travel size is perfect for getaways!",
            "review_2_quote": "\"Love this toothpaste. Dentist told me I needed to use sensitive toothpaste…really dislike the taste of most. Found this and it has worked great, tastes great. Have used this product for several years with no complaints. The subscription service works great! Would definitely recommend. The travel size is perfect for getaways!\"",
            "review_2_author": "Nancy S.",
            "review_3_highlight": "Thank you for making travel size",
            "review_3_quote": "\"I was so relieved to find out I can get my favorite toothpaste in a tsa approved travel size. I cannot use traditional toothpaste as I'm allergic to many of the ingredients. Boka is one of the few toothpastes I have found that does not cause a reaction around my mouth and I still love the taste. \"",
